8380 print
8390 print "  I am the little cave-sprite who guides people"
8400 print "as they explore the cave. You can tell me what"
8410 print "to do with one-word commands. For example, if you"
8420 print "want me to go North, you could type ""n"" or ""north"""
8430 print "Don't try to make me do outlandish things, such"
8440 print "as eating a dwarf. I don't like that, and sometimes"
8450 print "I get mad. If you happen to somehow be killed, I"
8460 print "can reincarnate you. Also, there is a facility for"
8470 print "saving and restoring your game to continue playing"
8480 print "at a later time. For information on this facility,"
8490 print "type ""info"". You can also get some up-to-date"
8500 print "game details by typing ""news""."
8510 print "You can also speed the game by moving long distances"
8520 print "by simply typing the name of the room that you want"
8530 print "to get to."
8540 print "Type ""commands"" to get a list of commands."
8550 print
8560 goto 4050
8570 print
8580 print "  I can save your game for as long as you want."
8590 print "To save your game type ""save"" followed by the name"
8600 print "that you wish to call it. If no name is specified, it"
8610 print "will be called ""SAVED_GAME_"". When you restore it,"
8620 print "also specify the filename. Again, if no filename is"
8630 print "given, ""SAVED_GAME_"" will be assumed."
8640 print "NOTE: Please specify the directory where you"
8650 print "want the game to be stored, otherwise it could be"
8660 print "lost if you don't have append permission to the"
8670 print "working directory."
8680 print
8690 goto 4050
8700 print
8710 print " This is the brand-new version of ""Explore""."
8711 print "09/10/26 - Resurrection of the game from line printer"
8712 print "           output, with assistance from Claude Opus 4.8,"
8713 print "           Sep 3-7, 2026. Changed mode default to quit."
8720 print "01/09/80 - Bugs and Changes in info segments."
8730 print "           >udd>Scouting>Lippard>lib>info"
8740 print "           contains them."
8750 print "           ""get all"" and ""drop all"" now work."
8760 print "05/01/80 - Implements ""-modes"" control argument, removes"
8770 print "           ""-mode"" control argument, adds "".ab"" command."
8780 print "           -modes must be followed by one or more of the following"
8790 print "           modes, separated by commas:"
8800 print "           quit, ^quit (default), brief, fast, full (default),"
8810 print "           multip, ^multip (default)"
8820 print "05/02/80 - New start_up.explore format, similar to exec_coms."
8830 print "           start_up.explore may be an entry in an exec_com."
8840 print
8850 print "05/11/80 - Implements ""-table_space"", ""-ts"" control argument"
8860 print "           to print amount of space database is using."
8870 print
8880 print "05/30/80 - Implements ""multip"" and ""^multip"" modes,"
8890 print "           for playing the game in multi-player mode."
8900 print "           Use ""talk"" to communicate."
